theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 24
text = "Preliminary Case Information

Only 4 people were on the premises on the day of the incident:

Octavio (victim), your son Peter, Helena (housekeeper) an John (cook).

The victim spent the day in his office holding meetings to finalize a major deal for his company (a partnership between him and his son). This information was corroborated by analysis of his computer and meeting logs.

After leaving the office, he took a shower and went to the wine cellar to meet his son for a dinner where they would discuss the specifics of the agreement.

According to his son's statement, Elena, the housekeeper, arrived carrying a food tray and an open bottle of wine with 2 glasses. Pedro poured the wine, tasted it, and handed the other glass to his father, who went into shock upon taking the first sip. His auto-injectors were not found in his room.

Death occurred 10 minutes later, while emergency responders were en route to the scene."

